      data:
        cutsceneName: DialogAction
        waitForCompletion: 1
        dialog:
          lines:
          - Hey, wait! Don't leave yet! Professor Oak was looking for you!
          - He asked me to find you and bring you to his lab. I can't remember why,
            though...
          - "Oh yeah! He said he wants to give you a Pok\xE9mon. Lucky you!"
          - Come on! Follow me!
