      value: 1.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: I'm just walking around this greenery. You know, because nature is cool.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I wonder how my brother is doing in Bretgate City.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: He won't let anyone pass because of some fallen logs "blocking" the
        route, and it's just stupid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: I mean, I could probably move them out of the way with help from one
        or two other people, but I guess the old guy doesn't care.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Oh, well. I'm sure he'll go away eventually.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
